   \\text{y4}(t)=\\frac{1}{12} e^{-2 t} \\left(3 e^{2
   t}-2 e^t \\sin (t)-4 e^t \\cos (t)+1\\right) \\\\
\\end{array}
\\right)\
\>", "Output",
